<title>USA: VISX, Autonomous in pact, settle suits.</title>
<headline>VISX, Autonomous in pact, settle suits.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>VISX Inc said Monday that it has entered into a patent license agreement with Autonomous Technologies Corp for the use of certain VISX patents for laser vision correction outside of the United States.</p>
<p>Patent lawsuits initiated by VISX against Autonomous in the United Kingdom and by Autonomous against VISX in Canada will be dismissed as a result of the license agreement.</p>
<p>In return for this license, Autonomous has agreed to pay royalties to VISX on the future sales of its system worldwide, excluding the U.S.</p>
</text>
